@*
    THE "Select from Evidence Center" dialog (migration 476, Phase 1).

    Driven by wwwroot/js/Shared/evidence-picker.js (window.gracEvidencePicker).
    Include this partial once on a page, load that script, and any screen on
    that page can open the same picker. Phase 1 caller: Operationalize
    (one-time evidence rows, resolve-workspace.cshtml). Phase 2 adds Task
    completion with the same dialog -- that is why it is shared from the
    start, the _obligation-form-dialog / obligation-form.js pattern.

    What it shows: Evidence Center items the caller can see (the procedure
    decides), the evidence row's type as the default filter, validity, the
    latest version and how many places use each item. An item that cannot
    be linked (expired, or already on this evidence) says why instead of
    offering Link.

    NOT A <form>: Enter in the search box must not submit and close the
    dialog. Every button is type="button".

    SELF-CONTAINED STYLES: every class is `gep-` prefixed and defined below,
    so the dialog renders the same on whichever page includes it.
    Included ONCE per page; the ids are global.
*@
<dialog class="gep" id="gepDialog" aria-labelledby="gepHeading">
  <div class="gep-form">
    <header class="gep-head">
        <h2 id="gepHeading">Select from Evidence Center</h2>
        <button class="pm-icon-button" id="gepClose" type="button" aria-label="Close">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i>
        </button>
    </header>

    <div class="gep-body">
        <p class="gep-note" id="gepContext"></p>
        <div class="gep-toolbar">
            <input type="search" id="gepSearch" placeholder="Search title, file name or tag" maxlength="200" />
            <label class="gep-check" id="gepTypeWrap" hidden>
                <input type="checkbox" id="gepSameType" checked />
                <span id="gepTypeLabel">Same evidence type only</span>
            </label>
        </div>
        <p class="pm-message" id="gepMessage" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>
        <div class="pm-table-wrap">
            <table>
                <thead><tr><th>Evidence</th><th>Type</th><th>Owner</th><th>Valid to</th><th>Version</th><th>Used in</th><th></th></tr></thead>
                <tbody id="gepBody"></tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
        <div id="gepPager"></div>
    </div>

    <footer class="gep-foot">
        <span class="gep-note">The link keeps the version you pick. A newer version is offered as an update later.</span>
        <button class="pm-button" id="gepCancel" type="button">Close</button>
    </footer>
  </div>
</dialog>

<style>
    /* Scoped to .gep so nothing here can reach another dialog. */
    .gep {
        width: min(960px, calc(100vw - 32px));
        max-height: calc(100vh - 64px);
        padding: 0; border: 0; border-radius: var(--radius-md);
        background: var(--bg-surface); color: var(--fg-default);
    }
    .gep::backdrop { background: rgba(15, 23, 42, .45); }
    .gep-form { display: flex; flex-direction: column; max-height: calc(100vh - 64px); }
    .gep-head {
        display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
        padding: 12px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .gep-head h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; flex: 1 1 auto; }
    .gep-body { padding: 14px 16px; overflow-y: auto; }
    .gep-foot {
        display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; justify-content: space-between;
        padding: 12px 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        background: var(--neutral-50);
    }
    .gep-toolbar { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 14px; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .gep-toolbar input[type=search] { flex: 1 1 260px; }
    .gep-check { display: inline-flex; gap: 6px; align-items: center; font-size: 13px; }
    .gep-note { color: var(--fg-secondary); font-size: 12px; margin: 0 0 8px; }
    .gep-foot .gep-note { margin: 0; }
    .gep-sub { color: var(--fg-secondary); font-size: 12px; }
    .gep-expired  { background: var(--danger-100); color: var(--danger-700); }
    .gep-expiring { background: var(--warning-50); color: var(--warning-700); }
</style>
